# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0020497> (Turcot syndrome with polyposis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:99818") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0020497> "Turcot syndrome with polyposis or Turcot syndrome type 2 is a form of familial adematous polyposis, characterized by the concurrence of thousands of colonic adenomatous polyposis or colorectal cancer (CRC) and a primary central nervous system tumor (principally medulloblastoma). It is also associated with pigmented ocular fundus lesions.")
