AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4021627/") rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0021018> "Terminology note: Autosomal dominant LGMD mapped to 7q36 has been classified as LGMD1E in OMIM, but as LGMD1D in the Human Gene Nomenclature Committee Database. In the literature there is another LGMD1D/E erroneously mapped to 6q, but we will use the acronym LGMD1D for the 7q-disease and LGMD1E for the 6q-form. LGMD1D is caused by heterozygous missense mutations in the DNAJB6 gene at chr. 7q36.3")
