# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0023297> (guttate psoriasis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://onlinelibrary-wiley-com.libproxy.lib.unc.edu/doi/epdf/10.1002/9781118661796.ch7") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0023297> "A form of psoriasis characterized by a sudden onset of small, red, and scaly teardrop-shaped spots that appear on the arms, legs, and middle of the body, usually triggered by an infection.")
