AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0023297> <http://identifiers.org/snomedct/37042000>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0023297> <http://linkedlifedata.com/resource/umls/id/C0343052>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0023297> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/ICD10CM/L40.4>)
